    "entrance": "Low west loading dock.",
    "exit": "Upper eastern gallery beyond sunlight.",
    "solution": "Load the carriage with the lantern and catch its ring from below. The stone tunnel fits cargo above the deck but not a standing knight. At the far end, the clasp collects the lantern high above the low dismount dock. Release onto the dock and wait for the carriage to clear. Jump straight up, dash Up, and press/hold Grab while rising through the clasp. The dash-catch keeps enough rise to carry the shade onto the high eastern balcony; walk through its sunlight to leave.",
    "nearestExisting": "Builds deliberately on B38\u2019s separate cargo/knight routes and B34\u2019s rising catch. In B38 the clasp is within ordinary jumping reach and the exit is at dock height. Here the lower dismount cannot reach the clasp normally, and the exit is a further elevated gallery: collection and ascent must become one continuous action.",
    "novelty": "The required transport creates an elevated pickup, which changes from storage into a momentum-preserving transfer. Catching after the dash has finished loses the height needed for the shaded balcony.",
